				1181,
				47
			],
			"Message": "build(Cocoon): Standardize ESBuild configuration and export syntax\n\nApply consistent formatting and import/export patterns across the Cocoon build pipeline. Migrate ambiguous default imports to explicit named exports (e.g., `export { default2 as default }`), consolidate environment constant imports to top-level declarations, and align indentation/spacing in configuration objects to match project styling.\n\nRefactor `Configuration/ESBuild` index and entry points to ensure proper module resolution order and eliminate redundant export wrappers. Update `Configuration/Mountain/Config.js` to match the standardized object formatting. Regenerate `Target/` build artifacts to reflect the configuration normalization. This cleanup resolves potential bundler inconsistencies and prepares the bootstrap pipeline for the upcoming gRPC server ordering fix.",
			"SHA": "eca6613cf68326d995003a282fef323d0a24897f"
		}
	],
